                "Additionally, the joint committee establishes automated cryptographic key rotation schedules, refreshing Diffie-Hellman private keys every 30 days. This forward secrecy architecture ensures that even in the unlikely event of an infrastructure compromise, past multi-party match tables remain completely unrecoverable, establishing an unbreachable barrier around enterprise sovereign customer records.",
